 "_comment": [
  "Seed list for the school picker, derived from ESLP application forms",
  "(2022, 2023, 2025) in the EdLight shared drive — the 'Établissement",
  "scolaire' and address columns only. No applicant name, email or phone is",
  "included, and rows shifted by '|' characters inside free-text answers",
  "were dropped rather than guessed at.",
  "",
  "`applicants` is how many applications named the school; the picker sorts",
  "by it so the schools students actually come from surface first.",
  "`commune` is inferred from the residence address and is empty where the",
  "form did not collect one (2022) — the picker asks for it on first use.",
  "",
  "This is a SEED, not the source of truth: the live list lives in Firestore",
  "and grows as students add their own school.",
  "",
  "Lives under shared/ because Metro only watches that folder — both the web app and the mobile app import this same file."
